OL,3,GNEWSAWork starts on #1m project to
OL,4,Aimprove bus journeys
OL,5,
OL,6,FConstruction work has begun to improve
OL,7,Ftraffic flow on a major route through
OL,8,FBradford city centre.
OL,10,FThe #1m Westgate Bus Hotspot scheme,
OL,11,Fwhich is due to last nine months, will
OL,12,Fsee changes made to roads between the
OL,13,Fformer Oastler Market and White Abbey
OL,14,FRoad.
OL,16,FNew bus lanes with cameras will be
OL,17,Fcreated along Westgate, along with
OL,18,Fimproved pedestrian crossings and
OL,19,Fcycling facilities.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
